  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12266 sets the parsing mode in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#html-fragment-parsing-algorithm to \"Disabled\". However the flag is for https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#fragment-parser-scripting-mode where Disabled is not included.\n\nI suspect https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parser-scripting-mode should be used here instead\n\ncc @noamr ",
